  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO Multipartner Support Programme Mechanism (FMM) (2021-2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2010, the Flexible Multi-Partner Mechanism (FMM) is FAO&#x2019;s main pooled funding mechanism for resource partners willing to contribute flexible, voluntary and multi-year resources to the Organization for the achievement of results under FAO&#x2019;s Strategic Framework and the realization of catalytic impacts.

The FMM has supports the development of innovative solutions for farmers and food producers and assists them in tackling emerging priorities. 

.</narrative>
  </description>
